    <p>The Special Needs Planning Institute is a 501(c)3 non-profit formed in 2007 to educate persons with a disability, their families and professionals on the various aspects of Special Needs Planning. Founded by Bart Stevens, author of "The Beginners' Guide to Special Needs Planning" and nationally recognized speaker and planning consultant for over 25 years, continues to provide planning services nationally.</p>

